  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the fused black and white heaven, a huge transparent pillar slams down and kills most of the soul beasts under it. Fairy Zi Wei identifies it as a heavenly pillar: each heavenly pillar is a rank nine heaven path immortal material. Central Continent’s Tian Ti Mountain could connect to Heavenly Court because it had a heavenly pillar. Ying Wu Xie notes that losing the concealment of soul beasts still leaves them with a rank nine immortal material.",
